<title>USA: IMM currency futures end shortened day higher.</title>
<headline>IMM currency futures end shortened day higher.</headline>
<text>
<p>July 3 - IMM currency futures ended a shortened trading session higher. The market closed at 1200 CDT/1700 GMT and will be shut on Friday for U.S. Independence Day. U.S. June payrolls data and unemployment rate showed economic growth was moderating slightly, and sparked dollar profit-taking, traders said.</p>
<p>((Chicago Derivatives Desk (312)408-8750))</p>
